ooc/collect:
============

This directory contains the OCT collection classes.  Once
translated and compiled, they are stored a library: "ocCltn.lib".
There is also a tester file, user.m.  This file excersises the
classes to demonstrate their methods.  The file 'make.32' creates
a large-code, large-data, 32-bit int version of the code (under
Aztec M68000).  The 32-bit version has also been tested under Xenix.

--- brian witt, 25-May-90
